{"id":"n58024-2-8","stage":4,"title":"뒤돌아보다 · 回顾","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58024-2-8-1","ko":"갑자기 무슨 여행이야?","zh":"怎么突然说要去旅行了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행이야?","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]}],"audio":"/audio/8aa751c3b4ffb57a8f79.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58024-2-8-2","ko":"시간을 가지고 나 자신을 뒤돌아보고 싶어.","zh":"我想抽点时间好好回顾一下自己。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"用，拿","explanation":"가지다：用，拿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"9","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자신을","meaning":"自身，自己","explanation":"자신：自身，自己；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자신","audio":"/audio/5239d0a84de6c1ea2bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62096","senseId":"1","lemma":"자신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤돌아보고","meaning":"回顾，回想","explanation":"뒤돌아보다：回顾，回想；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뒤돌아보다","audio":"/audio/dff96c20787e0f3b93d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58024","senseId":"2","lemma":"뒤돌아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싶어.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"用，拿","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"把某物作为工具或材料、手段或方法。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"5239d0a84de6c1ea","term":"자신","zh":"自身，自己","audio":"/audio/5239d0a84de6c1ea2bb6.mp3","entryId":"62096","definition":"本人。","pronunciation":["자신"]},{"id":"dff96c20787e0f3b","term":"뒤돌아보다","zh":"回顾，回想","audio":"/audio/dff96c20787e0f3b93d6.mp3","entryId":"58024","definition":"再次想以前的事。","pronunciation":["뒤ː도라보다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33